      "side": 1,
      "message": "The mix of DT_GPIO_\u003cenum\u003e and the lower case node label is somewhat confusing.\n\nIf GPIO_DT_LABEL(nodelabel) works equivalent to DT_GPIO_\u003cenum\u003e, then maybe we should consistently use GPIO_DT_LABEL().\n\nFrom a code search perspective, a user can more easily find all references to a GPIO by searching on the nodelabel.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
        "startChar": 24,
        "endLine": 30,
        "endChar": 53
      },
      "revId": "e9e96c691057e84a3797931371cf346c5ee1591c",
